Major breakthroughs in robotics this month:

@SkildAI  S1
In-context learning at a 10-minute horizon: learns unseen long-horizon tasks from a single video demonstration, without fine-tuning.

@DynaRobotics  Dyna-2
Showed human-to-robot scaling laws: more egocentric human video predictably improves performance across unseen robot embodiments.

@GeneralistAI  GEN-1.5
Emergent one-shot learning: learns new short-horizon robot tasks from a single 3–12 second demonstration, with zero gradient updates.

@perceptroninc  Isaac 0.5
A 36B open-weight model that brings perception, reasoning, and robot control into a single foundation model.

Robotics foundation models are moving fast.
